OL,3,GNEWSAWoman sets out to save van bought
OL,4,Ain memory of mum
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who bought a vintage van in
OL,7,Fmemory of her late mother has said it
OL,8,Fwas left in a worse condition following
OL,9,Fa #6,000 restoration.
OL,11,FRibs Norman, 54, from Folkestone,
OL,12,Fbought a 1976 Citroen 2CV with money
OL,13,Fleft to her after her mother, Sylvia
OL,14,FNorman, died from cancer aged 58.
OL,16,FAfter moving to Finland, she said the
OL,17,Fvehicle ended up abandoned in a field
OL,18,Fnear Herne Bay without her knowledge.
OL,19,FShe tracked it down using Google Earth.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
