OL,3,GNEWSAWoman sets out to save van bought
OL,4,Ain memory of mum
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe paid for a restoration only to find
OL,7,Fthe van had problems with the welding,
OL,8,Fbodywork, paintwork and electrics.
OL,9,FRibs, a science technician, has been
OL,10,Fworking through the problems with a
OL,11,Fmanual and sharing her progress online.
